{"id":"178443294dbca884","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Distribution Law","display":"df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law — ZFC Prob2 Distribution Law","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law — ZFC Prob2 Distribution Law","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law — ZFC Prob2 Distribution Law"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" href=\"?note=5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\">\\(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" href=\"?note=5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}law} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Omega=\\operatorname{dom}(X)\n\\land\\mathcal F=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y=\\bigcup\\mathcal E\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal E,X,\\nu)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}law} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Omega=\\operatorname{dom}(X)\n\\land\\mathcal F=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y=\\bigcup\\mathcal E\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal E,X,\\nu)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source probability space and target measurable carrier are recovered from the set-coded maps, then delegated to the fully typed pushforward-law predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"5c8ba0e6355b38cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"5c8ba0e6355b38cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}distribution\\text{-}law} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Omega=\\operatorname{dom}(X)\n\\land\\mathcal F=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y=\\bigcup\\mathcal E\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,\\mathcal E,X,\\nu)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1286,"backlinks":[{"id":"b961383f1e02dd7e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law.md|58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5c8ba0e6355b38cd"]}